comments:
btw @jfischer-phytec-iot  transfers are only canceled when the device was previously configured.
```
if (status == USB_DC_DISCONNECTED || status == USB_DC_SUSPEND) {
	if (usb_dev.configured) {
		usb_cancel_transfers();
		if (status == USB_DC_DISCONNECTED) {
			foreach_ep(disable_interface_ep);
			usb_dev.configured = false;
		}
	}
}
```
You can see an issue when swapping the device from native machine to virtual machine frequently. Then You run out of transfers pretty quickly. I will post more logs soon

